01:09:30.786 --> 01:09:32.412
and I can barely look you
in the eyes anymore.


01:09:34.748 --> 01:09:38.293
I can't concentrate in class.
I can't concentrate outside of class.


01:09:38.460 --> 01:09:40.336
Your son just...


01:09:40.504 --> 01:09:41.880
came and kicked
the ever-living shit out of me


01:09:42.047 --> 01:09:43.756
and I can't write anymore.


01:09:43.924 --> 01:09:48.511
So I'm just going to talk
for a minute.


01:09:48.679 --> 01:09:50.805
And you can just shut me up
whenever you feel like, okay?


01:09:50.973 --> 01:09:52.807
Go ahead, go ahead.


01:09:52.975 --> 01:09:55.643
All right,
so my friends...


01:09:58.355 --> 01:10:00.732
you know, the ones who were
pooling all their money together


01:10:00.900 --> 01:10:02.984
to pay for my tuition...


01:10:06.947 --> 01:10:09.699
that money that we
pulled together was dirty.


01:10:09.867 --> 01:10:12.368
All right.


01:10:12.536 --> 01:10:14.287
So what I'm basically
trying to tell you


01:10:14.455 --> 01:10:16.372
is that we started
an escort service


01:10:16.540 --> 01:10:18.750
that catered to your wife
and all of her friends.


01:10:18.918 --> 01:10:20.793
And I swear to God
I had no idea


01:10:20.961 --> 01:10:23.004
that it was your...


01:10:24.798 --> 01:10:26.966
that it was your wife.
And her friends


01:10:27.134 --> 01:10:29.802
were all just fuckin'...


01:10:29.970 --> 01:10:32.639
once this whole thing
started, man,


01:10:32.806 --> 01:10:37.644
I couldn't stop it.
I really really...


01:10:37.811 --> 01:10:39.270
it was going
just really well


01:10:39.438 --> 01:10:41.022
and then you came
and you told me


01:10:41.190 --> 01:10:43.816
that you got the school
to pay for my... my tuition


01:10:43.984 --> 01:10:45.818
and I felt awful.


01:10:47.655 --> 01:10:49.948
I just felt fuckin' awful.


01:10:50.115 --> 01:10:51.741
And I wanted to tell you about it,
but I couldn't.


01:10:51.909 --> 01:10:53.785
I didn't tell you about it,


01:10:53.953 --> 01:10:58.248
so then I went to the rental house
where we would,


01:10:58.415 --> 01:11:00.166
you know, do everything
and I tried to stop it.


01:11:00.334 --> 01:11:03.753
But I didn't stop it there because I
figured, "What the fuck?


01:11:03.921 --> 01:11:05.797
One night. One night.
One more time.


01:11:05.965 --> 01:11:09.884
Let's have one more time.
We'll go one more time."


01:11:10.052 --> 01:11:12.595
But it's not gonna be
one more time.


01:11:15.891 --> 01:11:18.893
Even if you hadn't caught us,
it wasn't gonna be one more time.


01:11:19.061 --> 01:11:20.478
And the only reason
you didn't catch me


01:11:20.646 --> 01:11:22.981
was 'cause I was out
alone with your...


01:11:23.148 --> 01:11:25.024
I was at your house...
your house!


01:11:25.192 --> 01:11:27.068
With your
fuckin' daughter.


01:11:30.990 --> 01:11:32.865
Post script: I had no idea
it was your daughter,


01:11:33.033 --> 01:11:35.076
but...


01:11:37.413 --> 01:11:39.289
I tried to come clean
with her.


01:11:39.456 --> 01:11:41.457
And...


01:11:44.545 --> 01:11:46.921
I don't know, man.
I'm just really fuckin' lost.


01:11:47.089 --> 01:11:48.965
And I know
that you're probably


01:11:49.133 --> 01:11:50.800
just super pissed


01:11:50.968 --> 01:11:53.011
and you don't care,


01:11:53.178 --> 01:11:55.054
but...


01:12:03.022 --> 01:12:05.606
Are you rolling a joint?


01:12:10.237 --> 01:12:11.988
I'm listening.


01:12:21.373 --> 01:12:23.249
You're not even mad?


01:12:23.417 --> 01:12:25.835
Kinda.


01:12:26.003 --> 01:12:27.670
Nah, not really.


01:12:27.838 --> 01:12:29.839
No.


01:12:31.925 --> 01:12:33.968
Come on, man.
I knew what was going on.


01:12:36.263 --> 01:12:38.639
You did?


01:12:38.807 --> 01:12:40.641
- You did?
- Well, of course I did.


01:12:40.809 --> 01:12:42.977
Find all your buddies
with a bunch of older women?


01:12:43.145 --> 01:12:45.355
And magical cash?


01:12:45.522 --> 01:12:48.691
I mean, I'm stupid,
but I'm not a fuckin' idiot.


01:12:50.069 --> 01:12:51.861
And you know what?
You said it.


01:12:52.029 --> 01:12:54.280
You didn't fuck my wife.


01:12:54.448 --> 01:12:57.200
You didn't know Courtney
was my daughter.


01:12:59.036 --> 01:13:01.579
And you did what you needed
to do to stay here.


01:13:01.747 --> 01:13:04.082
- So now what?
- Now what what?


01:13:04.249 --> 01:13:05.792
You gonna kick me
out of school?


01:13:05.959 --> 01:13:07.835
Nah.
Your friends?


01:13:08.003 --> 01:13:11.172
They took the heat for you.


01:13:13.050 --> 01:13:15.051
Anyway, you know what?


01:13:15.219 --> 01:13:17.095
You've been kicked out
of too many schools.


01:13:18.680 --> 01:13:20.348
So I told
the new headmaster that...


01:13:20.516 --> 01:13:22.892
Hang on. What do you mean
new headmaster?


01:13:23.060 --> 01:13:24.936
Oh yeah.


01:13:25.104 --> 01:13:27.397
I resigned this morning.


01:13:31.318 --> 01:13:33.569
The new headmaster
is English.


01:13:35.406 --> 01:13:38.241
I hear he wears bow ties.


01:13:40.077 --> 01:13:42.328
So,


01:13:42.496 --> 01:13:43.996
if you do stay here,


01:13:44.164 --> 01:13:45.706
your scholarship is safe.


01:13:45.874 --> 01:13:48.376
Look, man,
thank you, but...


01:13:53.048 --> 01:13:54.966
I have absolutely
no interest


01:13:55.134 --> 01:13:57.385
in staying here,


01:13:59.012 --> 01:14:01.681
I mean without you
or my friends, so...


01:14:01.849 --> 01:14:03.975
I figured as much.


01:14:14.111 --> 01:14:15.862
You know what?
You're gonna be all right.


01:14:16.029 --> 01:14:18.990
- I don't know about that.
- No, you're gonna be all right.


01:14:19.158 --> 01:14:21.033
I know.


01:14:21.201 --> 01:14:23.077
Really.


01:14:29.251 --> 01:14:31.043
So what are you gonna do
about your family?


01:14:32.379 --> 01:14:34.046
Well...


01:14:34.214 --> 01:14:37.842
that family...
my family's had problems


01:14:38.010 --> 01:14:40.344
for a long time
way before you came.


01:14:42.055 --> 01:14:43.806
And Judy and I, well,


01:14:43.974 --> 01:14:45.892
we were done years ago.


01:14:48.187 --> 01:14:49.729
Shawn.


01:14:49.897 --> 01:14:52.023
He's a troubled kid.


01:14:53.525 --> 01:14:56.068
I feel responsible
for all that trouble he has.


01:14:58.739 --> 01:15:01.157
But that's the gift
a father gives a son...


01:15:02.618 --> 01:15:04.577
resentment and scorn.


01:15:05.996 --> 01:15:07.455
He'll be all right.


01:15:07.623 --> 01:15:10.082
He'll come around
like when he's 29.


01:15:11.877 --> 01:15:14.420
And that little girl of mine?


01:15:14.588 --> 01:15:17.340
I don't worry
about her one bit.


01:15:17.508 --> 01:15:20.468
She has got it all, man.


01:15:20.636 --> 01:15:23.804
Got it all, that girl.


01:15:33.690 --> 01:15:35.608
- So what about you?
- Me?


01:15:39.071 --> 01:15:40.613
Well, me...


01:15:40.781 --> 01:15:42.865
can I ask you a question?


01:15:43.033 --> 01:15:44.534
Yeah.


01:15:44.701 --> 01:15:46.118
Seriously.


01:15:46.286 --> 01:15:48.496
You think I'm too old
to go back on the road?


01:15:48.664 --> 01:15:51.040
Nah.
Just wrap it up.


01:15:51.208 --> 01:15:53.334
Oh, I'm gonna
double-bag it.


01:15:53.502 --> 01:15:56.754
Oh yeah. I ain't
making that mistake again.


01:15:57.756 --> 01:16:00.007
Hey, do a bro
a solid, will you?


01:16:00.175 --> 01:16:01.259
Yeah, man.


01:16:01.426 --> 01:16:05.304
You take JetBlue
out of Ontario home tonight?


01:16:08.308 --> 01:16:09.809
Okay.


01:16:09.977 --> 01:16:11.727
Good.


01:16:13.021 --> 01:16:13.938
All right.


01:16:14.106 --> 01:16:15.982
Remember...


01:16:16.149 --> 01:16:19.235
heroes aren't born,


01:16:19.403 --> 01:16:21.404
they're cornered.


01:16:23.365 --> 01:16:25.783
- Bukowski?
- Mickey Rooney.


01:16:27.869 --> 01:16:29.537
Come on,
get out of here.


01:16:46.388 --> 01:16:48.222
That's good.


01:16:49.474 --> 01:16:52.018
I play so good
when I'm high.


01:17:10.037 --> 01:17:12.038
Excuse me. Sorry, man.


01:17:12.205 --> 01:17:14.123
Hi.


01:17:14.291 --> 01:17:17.585
- Hey, you need some help?
- Sam?


01:17:24.384 --> 01:17:26.135
Worst opening line ever.


01:17:31.224 --> 01:17:34.560
So what are you doing
taking my flight home?


01:17:34.728 --> 01:17:37.229
Your flight, huh?


01:17:37.397 --> 01:17:40.107
Well, if you must know,
I'm going to be living


01:17:40.275 --> 01:17:42.610
with my dad's parents
in The Village


01:17:42.778 --> 01:17:44.528
for the last year
and a half of high school.


01:17:44.696 --> 01:17:47.198
I hear they're eccentric
artists, so that's cool.


01:17:47.366 --> 01:17:49.408
That's cool.


01:17:51.244 --> 01:17:53.204
You really don't have
to help me with that. It's fine.


01:17:53.372 --> 01:17:56.540
Look, yes I do.


01:17:56.708 --> 01:17:59.752
By the way, how the hell do you plan
on getting all these bags past security?


01:17:59.920 --> 01:18:03.631
- I'm crafty.
- Crafty?


01:18:03.799 --> 01:18:05.800
If you'd like to ensure
safe passage of your bags,


01:18:05.967 --> 01:18:07.134
then maybe you should
let me take one.


01:18:07.302 --> 01:18:08.552
We can just say
we're together.


01:18:08.720 --> 01:18:10.221
Okay.


01:18:10.389 --> 01:18:12.390
It's cool.
It's my bag.


01:18:12.557 --> 01:18:16.435
Yeah, maybe, you know.


01:18:17.729 --> 01:18:19.438
Okay.


01:18:19.606 --> 01:18:21.315
- Okay.
- Maybe's okay.


01:18:28.365 --> 01:18:29.990
Thanks.


01:18:33.620 --> 01:18:36.789
- So...
- So...


01:18:38.709 --> 01:18:41.419
What's your
real story, Samuel?


01:18:49.511 --> 01:18:50.845
Got five hours to kill?


01:18:51.846 --> 01:19:31.846
